        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "OUR STORY"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/67b50a3a4b763b233e2c099a/935e886f-42fe-4d18-a229-edc331f3f43a/kingdom-heights-teachers-private-school-huntsville-al.jpg?format=1500w",
          "url": "https://www.khroyals.com/plan-a-visit"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "\"People don’t have ideas... ideas have people.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "In January of 2024, Pastors Scott and Britt Silcox were handed the baton from founding pastors, Pastors Rusty and Leisa Nelson, of head leadership at the Rock Family. The Rock is a legacy church in Huntsville, founded in 1999."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "As part of their inaugural Vision Sunday in August of 2024, Pastors Scott and Britt Silcox released the vision to start a K-12 school at the site of the historic Butler High School campus. This vision was met with resounding support from the congregation and Huntsville community."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/67b50a3a4b763b233e2c099a/4761c262-9673-4627-8cb8-44c9a52f8118/kingdom-heights-founding-pastors-giving-campaign-huntsville-al.jpg?format=1500w",
          "url": "https://pushpay.com/g/therockfamily?fnd=CRc58dBGQzTq7ZtbzztugQ&fndv=Lock&utm_source=pushpay&utm_medium=email&utm_content=link1&utm_campaign=PledgeCreated"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "hls": "https://video.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/67b50a3a4b763b233e2c099a/683b7e06-23d4-4b3e-a6dc-376387185a3f/playlist.m3u8",
          "thumbnail": "https://video.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/67b50a3a4b763b233e2c099a/683b7e06-23d4-4b3e-a6dc-376387185a3f/thumbnail",
